{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"id\":\"c26792cb-5e0e-4a63-ac1e-e8d99f3157ca\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Los mejores masajes de Panamá están aquí. Venir a este lugar es como un reinicio para poder continuar. Vale la pena cada minuto.\",\"quote_en\":\"The best massages in Panama are here. Coming to this place is like a reset so you can keep going. Worth every minute.\",\"author_name\":\"Fabián E.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"0878234c-dbf0-44f6-9fd0-1eb49c617d37\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Me dieron de regalo un masaje de 60 minutos y fue más de lo que esperaba: el staff, la atención, la masajista, el local… respirabas relajación inmediata.\",\"quote_en\":\"I was gifted a 60-minute massage and it was more than I expected: the staff, the attention, the therapist, the place… you breathed relaxation immediately.\",\"author_name\":\"Ileana M.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"21bf3a08-d60f-450a-9d36-fc8184d73ab1\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Cada vez que vengo es una experiencia maravillosa. El ambiente de relajación es perfecto.\",\"quote_en\":\"Every time I come it is a wonderful experience. The relaxing atmosphere is perfect.\",\"author_name\":\"Tania R.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":3,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"406aa350-c4a7-4afa-9d73-70cdf8326d65\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Mimosa nunca me ha decepcionado. He ido a varios lugares y siguen siendo los mejores en Panamá. Ambiente, masaje, sala de espera, atención: 5 estrellas.\",\"quote_en\":\"Mimosa has never disappointed me. I have tried several places and they are still the best in Panama. Atmosphere, massage, waiting lounge, service: 5 stars.\",\"author_name\":\"Ana Lorena P.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":4,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"46bca107-79d2-4fbf-98d4-e4c2354bdbdc\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Desde la llegada, la acogida fue muy agradable y la sala de espera es preciosa, tranquila y súper relajante, al igual que todo el lugar.\",\"quote_en\":\"From the moment we arrived the welcome was lovely, and the waiting lounge is beautiful, calm and deeply relaxing — just like the whole place.\",\"author_name\":\"Simone\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"bf198da3-09f8-497a-ab6b-bd22b50a4344\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Me encantó la atención, lo relajada que estuve todo el tiempo, el masaje delicioso y todo lo que te ofrecen al final. ¡Volvería sin duda!\",\"quote_en\":\"I loved the attention, how relaxed I felt the whole time, the delicious massage and everything they offer you at the end. I would absolutely come back!\",\"author_name\":\"Lena Paola C.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":6,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T18:12:47.700911+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"6e84fb0c-0af3-45da-999b-20a216a5f7f2\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"He ido a muchos spas y este está en el top 3. Servicio increíble y atmósfera perfecta: llegué con dolor de espalda y salí perfecta.\",\"quote_en\":\"I have been to many spas and this one is in my top 3. Incredible service and a perfect atmosphere: I arrived with back pain and left feeling perfect.\",\"author_name\":\"Dwan M.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":7,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"f4b16bda-4cbb-465f-a6e2-48b80ddb138e\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Desde hace años es mi lugar favorito: piensan en todo para que te sientas cómoda y relajada, y las terapeutas son muy profesionales.\",\"quote_en\":\"It has been my favorite place for years: they think of everything so you feel comfortable and relaxed, and the therapists are very professional.\",\"author_name\":\"Marissa M.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":8,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"5b9c5e3d-342e-4017-ae8b-0d74b1b101e2\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Bellísimo el lugar, es como un santuario de paz, y los masajes son muy buenos.\",\"quote_en\":\"The place is beautiful — like a sanctuary of peace — and the massages are very good.\",\"author_name\":\"Teresita Á.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":9,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"509f4477-19cb-4cd2-812c-4cef1521256e\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"¡El mejor spa de Panamá! Soy clienta desde hace años y sigo viniendo por su servicio de primera. Camas climatizadas, aceites excelentes y técnica profesional.\",\"quote_en\":\"The best spa in Panama! I have been a client for years and keep coming back for the first-class service. Heated beds, excellent oils and professional technique.\",\"author_name\":\"Ariadna R.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":10,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"29255cdb-a75c-47fa-8514-dce505e48093\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Excelente servicio premium a precio accesible. El personal es muy amable y profesional. Me encanta este lugar.\",\"quote_en\":\"Excellent premium service at an accessible price. The staff is very kind and professional. I love this place.\",\"author_name\":\"Keyla K.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":11,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"06844e9e-649a-49b2-a1ef-78adf26d8e49\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Lo máximo, una experiencia fantástica. Sinceramente, la experiencia supera con creces la inversión.\",\"quote_en\":\"The best — a fantastic experience. Honestly, the experience is worth far more than what you pay.\",\"author_name\":\"Nayeska C.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":12,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"68f1fd5c-d6ee-4aa9-bc77-b1956bb7ebd1\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Nuestra primera experiencia de masaje en pareja: instalaciones preciosas, ambiente tranquilo y una experiencia maravillosa. Al finalizar, programamos nuestra próxima cita.\",\"quote_en\":\"Our first couples massage experience: beautiful facilities, a peaceful atmosphere and a wonderful experience. Before leaving, we booked our next appointment.\",\"author_name\":\"Herman D.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":13,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"cde\"},{\"id\":\"04aed4e4-2588-42be-96e0-46ac27df1a9e\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Una experiencia inmersiva, sensorial y extraordinaria, llena de calma y relajación. El mejor masaje que he recibido en Panamá.\",\"quote_en\":\"An immersive, sensory, extraordinary experience, full of calm and relaxation. The best massage I have received in Panama.\",\"author_name\":\"Betty C.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":14,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"e18f34aa-033b-4c4e-a139-0a791aa4e65a\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Amando esta nueva sucursal. Llevo años siendo clienta de Mimosa en Costa del Este y siempre es una increíble y relajante experiencia.\",\"quote_en\":\"Loving this new location. I have been a Mimosa client in Costa del Este for years and it is always an incredible, relaxing experience.\",\"author_name\":\"Monique A.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":15,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"34717bb1-aff6-4296-9ba8-e60ccac6bae0\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"El equipo respondió con una rapidez increíble y el lugar es tranquilo, sereno e impecablemente limpio. Salí sintiéndome completamente aliviada.\",\"quote_en\":\"The team replied incredibly fast, and the place is calm, serene and impeccably clean. I left feeling completely relieved.\",\"author_name\":\"Grecia D.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":16,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"d9799bba-1ae9-411d-ab77-a5d2a4ba2d02\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Un lugar precioso con masajes fantásticos. La sala de espera cuenta con aguas aromatizadas, café espresso, champán y aperitivos. Un ambiente muy tranquilo y relajante.\",\"quote_en\":\"A beautiful place with fantastic massages. The lounge offers infused waters, espresso, champagne and snacks. A very calm, relaxing atmosphere.\",\"author_name\":\"Christine O.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":17,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"85a19357-4dde-4bc5-86aa-feeeafa8ffbb\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"¡Mimosa es el mejor lugar! Servicio siempre bueno y esta nueva sede está increíble.\",\"quote_en\":\"Mimosa is the best! The service is always great and this new location is incredible.\",\"author_name\":\"Diana C.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":18,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"f0e80a2b-99d8-4f25-b028-3f4274f5c60c\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Nos dimos un masaje en pareja y fue una experiencia muy agradable, relajante y revitalizante. El personal fue muy amable. Sin duda volveríamos.\",\"quote_en\":\"We had a couples massage and it was a lovely, relaxing and revitalizing experience. The staff was very kind. We would definitely come back.\",\"author_name\":\"Sandra O.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":19,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"},{\"id\":\"f394f8bd-37a6-4827-9149-0b451845016a\",\"kind\":\"review\",\"quote_es\":\"Personal muy amable y profesional, hermoso lugar y ambiente relajante desde que entras. Súper recomendado.\",\"quote_en\":\"Very kind, professional staff, a beautiful place and a relaxing atmosphere from the moment you walk in. Highly recommended.\",\"author_name\":\"Clara N.\",\"rating\":5,\"source\":\"google\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":20,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T19:37:43.79634+00:00\",\"location\":\"sfc\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["reviews"]}